# Generated by `npm run images -- --only=rituals`, which `prebuild` runs on every build.
# `public/rituals/` holds derived AVIFs whose sources live in `assets/rituals/`; the manifest is
# the dimensions module the timeline reads. Neither is committed — a fresh clone runs
# `npm run images -- --only=rituals` once before `tsc --noEmit` or `npm test` will pass.
